# Air-gapped image addresses for the kube-prometheus-stack release.
# Referenced from helmfile.yaml.gotmpl only when registryMode is `rewrite`.
#
# One line, because this chart has a real lever: global.imageRegistry replaces
# the registry segment of every image it renders, subcharts (grafana,
# kube-state-metrics, prometheus-node-exporter) included -- and those subcharts
# keep their own values, so the parent's per-component `registry:` keys never
# reached them. Dropping the upstream host is exactly what this key does, which
# is the layout every address here uses.
#
# This replaced twenty per-component `registry:` keys that all carried the same
# value. Verified equivalent, not assumed: rendering the release before and
# after produced the same twelve image references across the same nine
# addresses.
#
# ⚠️ Do not copy this shape to the other offline-images files. global.imageRegistry
# is a convention of this chart family, not a Helm feature -- rook, npd, lws,
# descheduler, gpu-operator and network-operator have no such key, which is why
# they name each `repository:` in full.
global:
  imageRegistry: {{ .Values.registry }}
